      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Oh, it's a stiff neck after sleeping badly. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I took the morning off to come in today. I just want to get back to normal, really.",
